# Apertus 8B Instruct 2509, Unsloth Q4_K_M GGUF (Apache-2.0 weights; see LICENSE below).
# The GGUF's own chat template (with Unsloth's tool-argument fixes) is kept: it is the only 8B v1 build
# whose tool calls Ollama parses. Do not add a TEMPLATE line.
